807,"lines":7,"used":true},{"source":"Carnatic Music Notations","url":"https://carnaticnotations.blogspot.com/2021/01/bhairavi-shreeramachandra-dhruva-geetham.html","score":0.955,"fit":1,"raga":1,"octave":0.977,"whole":0.907,"agree":0.807,"lines":7}],"meaning":{"source":{"name":"Geetham notes","author":"Gurukulam & SF","url":"","pages":[24]},"parts":[{"text":["Shree Raamachandra is like the Paarijaatha tree to all his devotees. He pleases one and all with his divine qualities. He is like the bee that flies over the lotus of Sita's face. May he grant benediction (i.e. bless us) forever."]}],"words":[{"lyric":["SrI rAmachandrAsrita pArijAta samasta","kaLyANa guNAbhi rAma sItA mukha ambOruha","sancharIka nirantaraM mangaLa mAta nOtu"],"text":["Shree Raamachandra is like the pArijAta (wish-fulfilling) tree to all (“samasta”) his devotees (“asritha”). He pleases one and all with his divine (“kaLyANa”) qualities (“guNa”). He is like the bee (“sancharIka”) that flies over the lotus (“amboruha”) of Sita's face (“mukha”). May He grant (“maata notu”) benediction (i.e. bless us) [“mangaLa”] forever (“nirantaram”)."]}]}}
